<title>UK: BASKETBALL-LATEST EUROLEAGUE STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-LATEST EUROLEAGUE STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings after Thursday's games</p>
<p>in men's EuroLeague basketball (tabulate under played, won,</p>
<p>lost, points)</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p> Stefanel Milan (Italy)	6  5  1  11</p>
<p> CSKA Moscow (Russia)	  6  3  3   9</p>
<p> Ulker Spor (Turkey)	   6  3  3   9</p>
<p> Maccabi Tel Aviv (Israel)   6  3  3   9</p>
<p> Limoges (France)		6  2  4   8</p>
