<p> Kinder Bologna (Italy)	   6  3  3   9</p>
<p> Sevilla (Spain)		    6  3  3   9</p>
<p> Partizan Belgrade (Yugoslavia) 6  3  3   9</p>
<p> Dynamo Moscow (Russia)	   6  1  5   7</p>
